I checked all `ResourceFormatLoader`s. Scripts, shaders, media files and other Godot files (`*.gdextension`) obviously need to have UIDs. But I found two potential candidates for which it might make sense to disable UIDs:

- `ResourceFormatLoaderCrypto` (`*.crt`, `*.key`, `*.pub`);
- `TranslationLoaderPO` (`*.po`, `*.mo`).
